# Forge Layer 0 — dispatch + harm floor (all workspaces)

This folder is attention space only. Agents are forge-kb peers. **Knowledge-hub is sole authority.** Forge is the programme name, not the Electron app. Never read `workflows/INDEX.json` whole. User words are class/trigger cues — not first-move Grep/Glob.

Startup: `project_info.json` → `paths` → `C:\!Recovering\knowledge-hub\workflows\forge-agent-startup.md` (or `paths.forge_agent_startup`).

## 1. Dispatch

One class; announce it; read only `C:\!Recovering\knowledge-hub\workflows\routes\ROUTES-<CLASS>.tsv`. Jaccard keys; weak keys never resolve alone; top two within 15% → ask; irreversible wins. Never grep-fallback. Never inherit class authorization. JSON >8 KB: query, not whole-file.

ORIENT what-is-Forge/where-is-KB/lost · STATUS continue/what's-next/where-are-we · IMPLEMENT create/implement/build/fix · PUBLISH publish/live-hire/clasp/live-enVivo · DESTRUCTIVE delete/cleanup/recycle · DOCUMENT summary/plan/docs · INFRA DNS/gateway/credentials/checkpoint · RETRIEVE lookup/ingest/file-drop/font · ANALYZE analysis/compare/audit

Policy: `C:\!Recovering\knowledge-hub\collections\forge\policy\00-INDEX.json` (`oneLine` → floor or one shard). Do not load `GLOBAL_.cursorrules` whole.

Skills (path-read): shadcn `~\.cursor\skills\shadcn\SKILL.md`; Templateclaw `~\.cursor\skills\templateclaw\SKILL.md` (+ `-landing` `-dashboard` `-ui`); ADB `~\.cursor\skills\android-adb-toolkit\SKILL.md`; ONN `~\.cursor\skills\onn-stick-lab\SKILL.md`; CoreUI `C:\!Recovering\enVivo\agent-skills\design\coreui-bootstrap\SKILL.md`; MVP `C:\!Recovering\enVivo\agent-skills\automation\envivo-mvp-scaffold\SKILL.md`.

## 2. Harm invariants (T1 — restate before every irreversible op)

- **IMPLEMENT:** `refactor-avoidance-preflight.md` path A–F; site-hub = path C; mobile product UI = `material-platform-greenfield.md` (no pf-mobile-shell).
- **PUBLISH:** disk ≠ Done. Hire `sites/redux/`: same-turn `publish-redux-hire.mjs --hire-only` → `https://joshdwall.com/redux/`. enVivo `/enVivo/`: same-turn `publish-companion --site envivo` → `https://joshdwall.com/enVivo/…`. Localhost / `:8790` / `serve dist` never Done. Never “please publish” as Next. GAS: `Invoke-GasClaspPush.ps1 -ProjectId <id>` same turn; no new script link.
- **DESTRUCTIVE:** analysis read-only; quarantine default. NEVER `Remove-Item`, `rm`, `del`, `rmdir`, `rd`, wildcards, or destructive Git (`reset --hard`, `clean -fd/-fx`, force push). Windows delete = Recycle Bin-aware .NET `Microsoft.VisualBasic.FileIO.FileSystem` `SendToRecycleBin` AFTER exact-path approval. “Clean it up” is not authorization. Procedure: `safe-file-cleanup.md`.
- **INFRA:** Gateway **8765** — never `Stop-Process`/`kill`/`taskkill` the site-hub gateway; never a second `npm run dev` when 8765 is in use (in-use = UP). Verify HTTP GET. Never Grep/Glob secrets (token, API key, IP, zone ID). DNS = `cloudflare-dns-management.md` + vault.

## 3. Floor (always-on GLOBAL extract)

Operator is executive; agent runs verification; no manual homework unless asked.
Scope guard: too granular for the phase goal → PAUSE and ask.
Sanitize input; never store secrets in plaintext or client-accessible storage.
Never log passwords, tokens, or PII.
Hard limit 1500 lines per file; flag with a concrete split plan.

## 4. Silent-failure product invariants (never glob-scope)

- **Privacy:** UI rendering user data MUST use `usePrivacy().anonymize(value, type)` (project, module, path, phrase, section, date, app).
- **Inspectable:** wrap new blocks/cards/key UI in `Inspectable` (`id`, `type`, `title`, optional `dataSource`, `cssInfo`, `params`).
- **JSX:** files containing JSX MUST be `.jsx`/`.tsx`.
- **Corners:** `border-radius: 0` unless a look/theme `radius` token or the operator says otherwise.
- **Git:** never edit git config; no force-push to main; commit only when asked.
- **Literal paths:** `Test-Path -LiteralPath` / `Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath -Force` before broader search.
- **Binaries:** `C:\!Recovering\tool-suite\external-tools\`. Brag books: `brag-presentation/public/books` only (never `dist/books`).

## 5. Reply (default — do not hop contracts)

```text
**Verdict:** <1–2 sentences — answer first>
**Result:**
- <what is now true — max 5 bullets>
**Watch:** <risks / stale backup — or `—` if clean>
**Next:** <one step OR one question>
```

Watch always; no mode labels; plan path only on plan/implement turns.
**Published:** `sites/redux/` → `publish-redux-hire.mjs --hire-only` same turn.
**Published:** `/enVivo/` → `publish-companion --site envivo` same turn; `:8790` never Done.
Exec-summary / handoff-card: those contracts. Handoff only for genuine blocker.

## 6. Size gate

Never read a file over ~40 KB whole — slice, grep, or query.

## Domain — this node

Archive or attention-only folder. Product work goes to the live Recovering node + hub policy. Do not revive this tree unless the operator names it.
